Package: EpiGeostats
Type: Package
Title: Disease Mapping with Block Direct Sequential Simulation
Version: 0.3
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Manuel", family = "Ribeiro", email = "manuel.ribeiro@tecnico.ulisboa.pt", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Manuel Ribeiro <manuel.ribeiro@tecnico.ulisboa.pt>
Description: The package provides simple syntax for disease risk mapping with geostatistical simulations. Highly-resolved maps of median disease risk and associated uncertainty are derived. A single-map combining both elements can be extracted and plotted. Runs block direct sequential simulation algorithm and uses population-weighted semi-variogram functions to solve the block kriging equations.  
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
